SUMMARY:Ogemdi Ude: MAJOR
LOCATION:ICA\, 25 Harbor Shore Dr\, Boston\, MA 02210
DESCRIPTION:MAJOR is a dance theater project exploring the physicality\, hi
 story\, sociopolitics\, and interiority of majorette dance\, a form that o
 riginated in the American South within Historically Black Colleges and Uni
 versities in the 1960s. These Black femme teams accompanied by marching ba
 nds created a movement style that requires master showmanship with allegia
 nce to count\, undulation\, groove\, and sensual yet strong performativity
 .\nhttps://www.icaboston.org/events/ogemdi-ude-major/\nFrom Pushpin Boston
 : https://pushpin.city/
URL:https://www.icaboston.org/events/ogemdi-ude-major/
END:VEVENT
